ence between them  continuing to do something today or not  or shutting down their whole business  really it's that important so if you  like something on youtube if you're  watching a video i'm not talking about  like the stupid cat videos  fine but if you're watching something  from somebody who's poured the heart  into something and it's had an impact on  you just let them know  let them know because that could make  the difference today for them continuing  on with their company  and second your second bit of homework  number two is thank somebody in your  life recognize the people who are making  an impact on your business in your life  who encouraged you to keep going  encourage you to keep trying to push  yourself when you thought about quitting  they were there for you  thank them it'll make you feel good  it'll make them feel good and more  generosity will come to you  so thank you so much  believe  if you guys like this video you know the  drill thumbs up below and hey you know  how much comments mean to me so please  leave a comment under the video let me  know what you think  let me know if you have a question for  your business i'll do a video response  thank you so much and i'll see you soon
 

